msgstr "It's cross, mind the sinkholes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
msgid "关系良好～这种时候最省心啦。"
msgstr "On good terms, safe and sound~"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT"
msgid "隔热的帽子～这个做得真厉害呢～"
msgstr "A heat-proof hat, impressive."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET"
msgid "小玩具～总会有想要它的孩子吧，先揣着好了～"
msgstr "A little trinket~ Some child will want it, surely."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARAMASA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARAMASA"
msgid "八连击的手套呀～挥起来很漂亮，可惜挑人。"
msgstr "An eight-hit glove~ Lovely to swing, though it is picky about its owner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE"
msgid "蜈蚣～这可挡不住我哟～"
msgstr "A centipede, it can't stop me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK"
