#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
