#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
