#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF"
