msgstr "If only there were a way to restart it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE"
