#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3"
msgid "知识很多，可惜我读不懂呢～"
