#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT"
