#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN"
