#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "「别玩火柴」～这下说服力十足啦～"
msgstr "'Don't play with matches.'"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "上面写着「那边」～那边是哪边呀～"
msgstr "It says 'over there'."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "空白的牌子～"
msgstr "A blank sign."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
