#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "总会有个解释的吧～大概～"
msgstr "There'll be an explanation, probably."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS"
