#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP"
msgid "香气就是味道～"
