#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "力量在增加哟～"
