#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
