msgstr "A person shedding skin, something different within."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
