msgstr "A painting of a vast city of technology."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "完完全全的非现实～我喜欢这种～"
msgstr "Entirely unreal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.AXE"
