msgstr "A pack, holds plenty."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "完美的早餐～这个我能连吃三份哟～"
