#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE"
msgid "游戏机～来一局怎么样？"
msgstr "A game machine, how about one round."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "为什么会浮着呢？想不明白的事就别想啦～"
