#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY"
msgid "小的都在里面呀？它们是怎么进去的嘛～"
