msgstr "An ordinary balloon~"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC"
