#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY"
