#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC"
