#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY"
