#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY"
