msgstr "A stopgap for now."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT"
