#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "它动了吗？再看一眼～"
msgstr "Did it move?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
