msgstr "Dying down, add fuel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
