msgstr "It's over... right?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
