msgstr "I'd rather not believe my eyes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
