#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
