#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "热腾腾的口水呀～真没礼貌呢～"
msgstr "Hot spit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
