msgstr "A lava pond, the rock is warm~"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
