#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "算是素食，可里面含着残酷呢～"
msgstr "Vegetarian, yet cruel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
