#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "用木头雕树～这不是绕远路吗～"
