msgstr "It's waiting for something."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "钓上来了～接下来得找裂缝呢～"
msgstr "Caught it, now find the crack."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
