msgstr "A mushroom hat, cute."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
