#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
