#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
