#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
