#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.ARIEL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "好大一颗蘑菇～"
