msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "这是盐水。植物不喝，记住了吗？"
msgstr "Salt water. Plants won't drink it. Understood?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "深海用这种竿子？我可不打算自己跳下去捞。"
msgstr "The deep sea? Not with this rod. I have no intention of going in myself."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC"
msgid "骗我？你胆子不小啊。……哼，我记住你了。"
msgstr "Trying to trick me? How bold."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "试过了，不行。"
msgstr "Tried it. Doesn't work."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "在忙。等着。"
msgstr "Busy. Wait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "复活不了。死了就是死了，认命吧。"
msgstr "It can't be revived. Give up."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "已经在玩了。排队等着。"
msgstr "Already playing. Queue up."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY"
msgid "是洞的问题，不是我的问题。"
msgstr "It's the hole's fault. Not mine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
msgid "要代币。去赢一个来。"
msgstr "Tokens required. Go win some."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "死了。死人收不了东西。"
msgstr "Dead. Can't accept it. Useless."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "这个我早就有了。别浪费我的时间。"
msgstr "I know it already. Don't waste my time."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "还有一份没吃完。"
msgstr "One serving still unfinished."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "放这里不对。挪走。"
msgstr "That doesn't go there. Move it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "这个主意不好。死者的东西别乱碰。"
msgstr "That idea is not a good one."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "要活木才行。"
msgstr "Living logs would suit it better."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "要蘑菇才行。"
msgstr "Mushrooms would suit it better."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "它们不肯被种下。区区蘑菇，也敢挑三拣四？"
msgstr "They refuse to be planted. The nerve."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL"
msgid "算了，不放了。"
msgstr "Not putting it in."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "看不见月亮。"
msgstr "No moon in sight."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY"
msgid "猴子话我不会说，也不想学。"
msgstr "Monkey language? I don't speak it. Nor do I care to."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY"
msgid "形状不合。"
msgstr "Wrong shape."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "它不吃这个。"
msgstr "It won't eat this."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "算了，不放了。"
msgstr "Not putting it in."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "雕不了。手艺不够就别乱试。"
msgstr "Can't be carved. Poor craftsmanship."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "形状不合。"
msgstr "Wrong shape."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "太危险了。这种时候玩游戏，是想死吗？"
msgstr "Too dangerous. Not now."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "先收拾干净。脏东西我不想看。"
msgstr "Clean up first."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "太晚了。散了吧。"
msgstr "Too late."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY"
msgid "她在忙。别去催，免得被咬。"
msgstr "She's busy. Don't rush her."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "睡着了，叫不醒。"
msgstr "Asleep. Can't wake them."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "已经放过了。"
msgstr "Already done it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT"
msgid "口袋装不下两个。我又不是杂货铺。"
msgstr "Two won't fit in a pocket. I am not a general store."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN"
msgid "得等它长回来。……我的耐心一向不好。"
msgstr "Wait for it to grow back. Patience."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE"
msgid "换别的燃料试试。"
msgstr "Try another fuel..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "颜色不对。你的眼睛没问题吧？"
msgstr "Wrong color. Are your eyes all right?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
