#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "睡着了。"
msgstr "Asleep."

