msgstr "Only works on merms. Why would I even know that."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY"
msgid "它们不听我的。……真气人，明明我比谁都强。"
msgstr "They won't listen to me. Webber might, perhaps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED"
msgid "已经拴好了。"
msgstr "Already hitched."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD"
msgid "它静不下来。谁去哄哄它，我不会那种事。"
msgstr "It won't settle down. Someone calm it."

