#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "刚才动了？"
msgstr "Did it move?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
