#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "还得再收几只。全归我。"
msgstr "Collect more. For research."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "名字我想好了。「猫一号」，「猫二号」。"
msgstr "They need names. \"Cat One\", \"Cat Two\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "还得再收几只。全归我。"
msgstr "Collect more. For research."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "可爱的猫崽子。"
msgstr "A cute little cat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "还得再收几只。全归我。"
msgstr "Collect more. For research."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "这是什么怪物！"
msgstr "What manner of monster is this!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "鹿角做的钥匙。豪华。"
msgstr "A key made of antlers. Extravagant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "绝对要打开。"
msgstr "I will open it. Absolutely."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "骑士。让我看看。"
msgstr "A knight. Let's see."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "骑士的噩梦版。"
msgstr "A knight. The nightmare edition."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING"
msgid "很会跟着我。算你懂事。"
msgstr "A fine knight!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
msgid "它听谁的？真没眼光。"
msgstr "Whose boss are you?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "别闹。给我安静点。"
msgstr "Enough of that!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
