#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "又利又大的刀。……不过我的大剑更强。"
msgstr "A sharp, huge blade.... My greatsword is better."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "还要钥匙。"
msgstr "It wants a key."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
