msgstr "This will do."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "攻击稍微更疼了。"
msgstr "Attacks sting somewhat more."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "投掷用的武器。"
msgstr "A throwing weapon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
