msgstr "The way we came. I hope it's the way back."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "我先走。"
msgstr "I shall go on ahead."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
