msgstr "It hastens the crystal's power."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
