msgstr "The enemies come from here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
