#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
