msgstr "Hot. It cannot be touched."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
