msgstr "Eaten in the morning... or is it dinner?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
