msgstr "Hey. Stop harassing the plants."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.SOPHIA.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1"
