#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2"
msgid "亡魂。已经很像样了。"
msgstr "A ghost. Quite presentable now."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
