msgstr "I want to know what it would do. Worth dying for."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET"
