msgstr "I carry some weight here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE"
