msgstr "I want to use it, and I want the world to know I used it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACORN"
msgid "里面确实有东西。"
msgstr "There really is something inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED"
msgid "烤得刚好。"
msgstr "Roasted just right."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING"
