msgstr "It'll grow into a tree soon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL"
