msgstr "It shows me endless possibility."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD"
msgid "哪怕只有一片，也很有启发。"
msgstr "Even one fragment is enlightening."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED"
msgid "它把那只怪物的能量抽出来了。"
msgstr "It drained the monster's energy out."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD"
msgid "抓到了。"
msgstr "Caught it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC"
msgid "砸坏那么多东西，你要付出代价。"
msgstr "You'll pay for smashing up so much."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "你看着一样，又不一样。"
msgstr "You look the same, yet different."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT"
msgid "这一定就是他要的那个。"
msgstr "So this must be the one he wanted."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD"
msgid "这次我确定打中了。"
msgstr "This time I'm sure I hit it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC"
msgid "我大概只是把它弄生气了。"
msgstr "I probably just made it angry."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE"
msgid "你的意思我明白了。"
msgstr "I understand what you mean."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3"
msgid "它现在确实生气了。"
msgstr "It's genuinely angry now."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD"
msgid "该有人去戳一下……为了确认。"
msgstr "Someone should poke it... for verification."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB"
msgid "它死了吗。那股奇怪的能量还留在它周围。"
msgstr "Is it dead. That strange energy still lingers around it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP"
