msgstr "After repeated trials, I can confirm they make me want to sleep."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "你砸坏的东西还不够多吗。"
msgstr "Haven't you smashed enough already."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "戴着它很安心。"
msgstr "Wearing it is reassuring."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR"
msgid "我不想让船漂走。"
msgstr "I don't want the boat drifting off."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM"
