msgstr "Now an anchor can be made."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM"
