msgstr "Freshly picked from the tree, still warm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION"
