msgstr "If only it didn't tremble so much."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED"
