msgstr "At least it doesn't tremble anymore."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC"
