msgstr "It's growing. I think."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
