msgstr "It seems to have adapted, but it isn't time to grow yet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "我想它在这里得不到需要的养分。"
msgstr "I don't think it gets the nutrients it needs here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
