msgstr "It finally fell apart."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
