msgstr "It needs fertilizing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING"
