msgstr "It's working hard on the next batch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED"
