msgstr "Even the juicy berries got baked dry."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE"
