msgstr "It looks a bit hungry."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
