msgstr "A fine bird."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
