msgstr "It's asleep."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
