msgstr "How long since anyone fed you."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING"
