msgstr "Now that's a fire bird."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC"
