msgstr "I say it's a fowl."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING"
