msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT"
msgid "一个即将成为船缓冲的东西。"
msgstr "Something about to become a boat bumper."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD
