#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
