msgid "今天闻到的最臭的东西。"
msgstr "The most foul thing I've smelled today."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "现在没得住了。"
msgstr "No home now."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "谁会住在这里。"
msgstr "Who would live here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
msgid "这味道。"
msgstr "That smell."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "其实还算可爱。"
msgstr "Actually rather cute."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "陛下。"
msgstr "Your Majesty."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "那张王座本来就有鱼腥味。"
msgstr "That throne smelled of fish from the start."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "适合沼泽之王坐。"
msgstr "Fit for a swamp king to sit on."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "现在我们大概永远不会知道它是做什么的了。"
msgstr "Now we'll probably never know what it was for."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "她在打算什么。"
msgstr "What is she planning."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "一队没有王可护的护卫。"
msgstr "A guard detail with no king to guard."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "他们似乎很高兴找到了王。"
msgstr "They seem delighted to have found a king."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
msgid "上面写着\"鱼人专用\"。"
msgstr "It says \"merms only\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED"
msgid "上面写着\"鱼人专用\"。"
msgstr "It says \"merms only\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR"
msgid "鱼人进化的下一个阶段。"
msgstr "The next stage of merm evolution."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
msgid "他们按先到先称王的规矩办事。"
msgstr "They follow the first-come-first-crowned rule."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW"
msgid "只是他们从前的影子。"
msgstr "Just the shadows they used to be."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL"
msgid "它什么都能做，但都做得很差。"
msgstr "It does everything, and does it all badly."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED"
msgid "我想我在那里面找不到什么有学问的东西。"
msgstr "I don't think I'd find anything learned in there."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED"
msgid "我想我在那里面找不到什么有学问的东西。"
msgstr "I don't think I'd find anything learned in there."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
msgid "这件工具有点鱼腥味。"
msgstr "This tool has a bit of a fishy smell."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "不知道是给我的吗。"
msgstr "Don't they know it's for me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "里面什么都没有。"
msgstr "There's nothing inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT"
msgid "它现在拉不伤任何肌肉了。"
msgstr "It can't strain any muscles now."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC"
msgid "光看着它，我的肌肉就拉伤了。"
msgstr "Just looking at it strains my muscles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES"
msgid "……难吃。"
msgstr "...Awful."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "不用手就能照亮。"
msgstr "Lights the way without using hands."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "很亮。"
msgstr "Very bright."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "不知为何，风从背面吹得更快。"
msgstr "Somehow the wind blows faster from the back."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "点起来能让所有人知道我在这里。"
msgstr "Light it, and everyone knows I'm here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "我画得比那个好。"
msgstr "I draw better than that."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "该在上面画点什么。"
msgstr "Something should be drawn on it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "这样放着没用。该立起来。"
msgstr "Useless lying flat. Should be stood up."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "那东西看着不高兴。"
msgstr "That thing looks displeased."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "里面可能有好东西。也可能是坏东西。"
msgstr "Good things might be inside. Or bad things."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "幸好没被顶到。"
msgstr "Glad I wasn't gored."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD"
msgid "它冷掉了。"
msgstr "It's gone cold."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC"
msgid "那些螨虫身上不只有热气。"
msgstr "There's more than heat to those mites."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED"
msgid "我把它煮了……但我真的想吃吗。"
msgstr "I cooked it... but do I actually want to eat it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "想敲它一下。"
msgstr "Feel like tapping it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "没有土可以挖了。"
msgstr "No dirt left to dig."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "底下有东西在找矿。"
msgstr "Something down there is prospecting."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT"
msgid "一只标准的鼻血鬼。"
msgstr "A standard nosebleed vampire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL"
msgid "不知道那个乱窝里卡着什么。"
msgstr "Wonder what's stuck in that chaotic nest."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "很臭。但看得清。"
msgstr "Smelly. But I can see clearly."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "地上一个还算舒服的洞。"
msgstr "A reasonably comfortable hole in the ground."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "好奇的小东西。"
msgstr "A curious little thing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "那个刚才动了吗。"
msgstr "Did that just move."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT"
msgid "我说过了。"
msgstr "I said so."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "树屋是极易燃的实验场所。"
msgstr "Treehouses are highly flammable laboratories."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL"
msgid "什么都进不去，但它一直往外吐东西。"
msgstr "Nothing can get in, but it keeps spitting things out."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS"
msgid "这台机器看着奇怪地熟悉。"
msgstr "This machine looks strangely familiar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR"
msgid "名副其实的支柱。"
msgstr "A pillar worthy of the name."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN"
msgid "她看起来是这里的头。"
msgstr "She appears to be the one in charge here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "不知道它们能不能吃。也许该做个试验。"
msgstr "Wonder if they're edible. Perhaps an experiment is in order."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT"
msgid "我觉得它让我看着很有船长的气派。"
msgstr "I feel it gives me quite the captain's air."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT"
msgid "至少能让我的头发保持干燥。"
msgstr "At least it keeps my hair dry."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "这道菜是对学问的侮辱。"
msgstr "This dish is an insult to learning."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "这个我不该吃。"
msgstr "I shouldn't eat this."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "味道奇怪的肉干。"
msgstr "Jerky with a strange taste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE"
msgid "这附近总该有别的东西能吃。"
msgstr "There must be something else to eat around here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "全碎了。"
msgstr "All shattered."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "中间有个洞。要放东西进去。"
msgstr "A hole in the middle. Something goes in it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "那块石头把它点亮了。"
msgstr "That stone lit it up."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "然后呢。"
msgstr "And then what."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "这个明显不对。"
msgstr "This one is clearly wrong."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "我丰富的学识告诉我，那是……月蝶。"
msgstr "My vast learning tells me that is... a moon moth."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "抓到你了。"
msgstr "Caught you."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "现在真的靠翅膀了。"
msgstr "Now it's really down to the wings."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING"
msgid "蛾变成树。真是疯了。"
msgstr "Moth into tree. Utterly mad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "这下面没有月亮可以观测。"
msgstr "No moon to observe down here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "水会放大效果。用来观测月亮。"
msgstr "Water amplifies the effect. For observing the moon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED"
msgid "有种被盯着的感觉。"
msgstr "A feeling of being watched."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "满月。"
msgstr "Full moon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "新月。"
msgstr "New moon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "月亮在亏。"
msgstr "The moon is waning."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "月亮在盈。"
msgstr "The moon is waxing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER"
msgid "only_used_by_woodie"
msgstr "only_used_by_woodie"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS"
msgid "非常锋利。"
msgstr "Extremely sharp."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE"
msgid "我让它格外有效。"
msgstr "I make it extra effective."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED"
msgid "该在能量散掉之前把它用掉。"
msgstr "Should be used before the energy fades."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK"
msgid "我几乎能在上面看见自己。"
msgstr "I can almost see myself in it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "一块月玻璃，里面有月龙虾。"
msgstr "A moonglass, with moon lobsters inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "该往里面塞点亮的东西。为了确认。"
msgstr "Should stuff something bright in there. For verification."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "要我跪下？不可能。"
msgstr "Kneel? Impossible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "那块石头来自月亮。"
msgstr "That stone came from the moon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "里面有东西。"
msgstr "Something is inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "我大概能把它敲开。"
msgstr "I could probably crack it open."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN"
msgid "那不是普通的蜘蛛巢。"
msgstr "That's no ordinary spider den."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC"
msgid "它像玻璃。"
msgstr "It looks like glass."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED"
msgid "它带着不属于这里的能量在发光。"
msgstr "It glows with energy that doesn't belong here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "当然。把月亮的能量和马铃薯的能量合起来，我怎么没想到。"
msgstr "Of course. Moon energy plus potato energy. How did I not think of that."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK"
msgid "我就叫它\"希格斯伯里粒子\"。"
msgstr "I'll call it the \"Higgsberry particle\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC"
msgid "新的发现，很带电。"
msgstr "A new discovery. Very electrifying."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER"
msgid "里面什么都没有。"
msgstr "There's nothing inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM"
msgid "它让我的头发做出奇怪的事。"
msgstr "It makes my hair do strange things."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER"
msgid "它似乎在传输中迷路了。"
msgstr "It seems to have gotten lost in transit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "嗯。你说什么。"
msgstr "Hm. What did you say."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP"
msgid "它想被完成。"
msgstr "It wants to be completed."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL"
msgid "它似乎是某个更大机构的一部分。"
msgstr "It seems to be part of some larger institution."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC"
msgid "它像是在等什么。"
msgstr "It seems to be waiting for something."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "我把它钓上来了，现在去找裂缝。"
msgstr "I fished it up. Now to find the fissure."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
msgid "它不想待在地上。"
msgstr "It doesn't want to stay on the ground."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON"
msgid "我大概知道你该在哪里。"
msgstr "I roughly know where you belong."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL"
msgid "我有一种要把它带去某处的冲动。"
msgstr "I have an urge to carry it somewhere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK"
msgid "它一定在朝着什么积累。"
msgstr "It must be building toward something."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS"
msgid "里面有东西被困着。"
msgstr "Something is trapped inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL"
msgid "里面有东西被困着。"
msgstr "Something is trapped inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "里面有东西被困着。"
msgstr "Something is trapped inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED"
msgid "它要我给它一个安身的地方。"
msgstr "It wants me to give it a place to settle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD"
msgid "它想和其他的在一起。"
msgstr "It wants to be with the others."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP"
msgid "看着不太有食欲。"
msgstr "Not very appetizing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "为了确认，我做过不少事。"
msgstr "I've done plenty of things for verification."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1"
msgid "学问才刚开始。"
msgstr "The learning is just beginning."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2"
msgid "这已经有学问的样子多了。"
msgstr "This looks considerably more like learning now."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC"
msgid "它把能量装住了。我当然一直都知道它是做什么的。"
msgstr "It contains the energy. I of course always knew what it does."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC"
msgid "脑子里同时跳出安宁和警告。这设计有点意思。"
msgstr "Peace and a warning leap through my mind at once. Clever design."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT"
msgid "这地方的裂缝开始显出来了。"
msgstr "The cracks here are starting to show."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED"
msgid "不太合规则……但相当有效。"
msgstr "Not quite by the rules... but highly effective."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "那棵树在烧。"
msgstr "That tree is burning."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "那棵树烧倒了。"
msgstr "That tree burned down."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "那棵树相当粗。"
msgstr "That tree was quite thick."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "我不知道月亮上也长树。"
msgstr "I didn't know trees grew on the moon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "它从月亮树上落下来。"
msgstr "It fell from a moon tree."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED"
msgid "晒得不错。"
msgstr "Dried nicely."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "我不太清楚那是什么东西。"
msgstr "I'm not sure what that thing is."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "那些孩子像想逃出去的电子。"
msgstr "Those children look like electrons trying to escape."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "它把孩子放在那里。"
msgstr "It left its children there."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA"
msgid "他做菜的本事，和我做学问的本事一样。"
msgstr "His cooking skill matches my learning skill."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "恶心的吸血小东西。"
msgstr "A disgusting little bloodsucker."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "那是我的血吗。"
msgstr "Is that my blood in there."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB"
msgid "我很想把它扔出去。"
msgstr "I'm itching to throw it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER"
msgid "植物似乎喜欢这个。"
msgstr "The plants seem to like it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE"
msgid "这是鱼人之间最新的话题。"
msgstr "The latest hot topic among merms."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK"
msgid "那些吸血的东西再也碰不到我。"
msgstr "Those bloodsuckers will never touch me again."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "那大概是别人的血。"
msgstr "That's probably someone else's blood."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "啊。你显然不是电子。"
msgstr "Ah. You are clearly not an electron."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "它大概是自找的。"
msgstr "It probably asked for it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "下面一定有不少好东西。"
msgstr "There must be plenty of good things under there."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK"
msgid "这杯酒后劲很足。"
msgstr "This drink hits hard on the back end."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "连接用的门。构造很粗糙。"
msgstr "A connecting door. Crudely built."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "这东西的原理，我看得懂。"
msgstr "I can understand how this thing works."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "很聪明的东西。"
msgstr "A very clever thing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME"
msgid "它也许有攻击性。但只是偶尔。"
msgstr "It might be aggressive. Only occasionally."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "一朵即将成形的蘑菇云。"
msgstr "A mushroom cloud taking shape."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "戴上就成了菌类的同伴。"
msgstr "Wear it and you join the fungus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "长得很没有礼貌。"
msgstr "Grew up very impolitely."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "有意思。"
msgstr "Interesting."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "我把它烧了。"
msgstr "I burned it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "需要一颗孢子。或者移植一朵。"
msgstr "Needs a spore. Or a transplanted one."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "蘑菇很喜欢这根木头。"
msgstr "The mushrooms love this log."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "木头死了。该换一根活的。"
msgstr "The log is dead. Needs a live one."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "这种冷度下长不起来。"
msgstr "This cold won't let anything grow."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "接下来会继续长。"
msgstr "They'll keep growing from here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "好多蘑菇。"
msgstr "So many mushrooms."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "烧得很彻底。"
msgstr "Burned thoroughly."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "一朵很大的蘑菇。"
msgstr "A very large mushroom."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "它亮起来了。"
msgstr "It lit up."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "不是我把它弄霉的。"
msgstr "I didn't mold it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "用三原色能做出很好的光源。"
msgstr "The three primary colors make a fine light source."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "蓝色是最讲道理的颜色。"
msgstr "Blue is the most reasonable color."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "上面全是酸。"
msgstr "Covered in acid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "稍微感到不快。"
msgstr "Slightly displeased."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "这种以前长在我的浴室里。"
msgstr "This kind used to grow in my bathroom."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON"
msgid "这棵蘑菇树显然比其他的更怪。"
msgstr "This mushroom tree is clearly stranger than the others."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "上面全是酸。"
msgstr "Covered in acid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "它在试着繁殖。"
msgstr "It's trying to reproduce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "会让人产生幻觉的蘑菇？"
msgstr "A hallucinogenic mushroom?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "上面全是酸。"
msgstr "Covered in acid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "远看不出来。近了很臭。"
msgstr "Invisible from afar. Smelly up close."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "这朵蘑菇长得对自己没好处。"
msgstr "This mushroom's growth does it no good."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "上面全是酸。"
msgstr "Covered in acid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC"
msgid "蜘蛛觉得这一棵很重要。"
msgstr "The spiders consider this one important."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER"
msgid "事情要变得毛躁了。"
msgstr "Things are about to get shaggy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD"
msgid "我想那算是罕见的鸟。"
msgstr "I'd call that a rare bird."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE"
msgid "别管我，我只是在吃腐肉。"
msgstr "Leave me be, I'm only eating carrion."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC"
msgid "我佩服它对死的执着。"
msgstr "I admire its dedication to death."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS"
msgid "它眼睛里有点东西。"
msgstr "There's something in its eyes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD"
msgid "现在能松口气了。"
msgstr "Now I can breathe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "不妙。"
msgstr "Not good."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING"
msgid "我非常想跑。"
msgstr "I very much want to run."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG"
msgid "你的眼睛又大又亮。"
msgstr "Your eyes are big and bright."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD"
msgid "到此为止。"
msgstr "This ends here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "那东西很可怕。"
msgstr "That thing is dreadful."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "还好。它在睡。"
msgstr "Fine. It's asleep."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER
