msgstr "It gives off an eerie light."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
