msgstr "Those crystals might be worth worrying about."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
