msgstr "I'm not a geologist."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION"
msgid "那肯定是某种石头。"
msgstr "That must be some kind of rock."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT"
