msgstr "It grips firmly."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED"
