msgstr "Now there's real traction."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT"
