msgstr "Dry as a bone."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC"
