msgstr "Is that a mirage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM"
