#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL"
