msgstr "The fish will take a keen interest in this."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY"
