#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN"
