#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN"
