#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN"
msgid "小一点的鱼会觉得这个很吸引。"
msgstr "Smaller fish would find this enticing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED"
msgid "小一点的鱼会觉得这个很吸引。"
msgstr "Smaller fish would find this enticing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD"
