msgstr "Hope it tastes better than it looks."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2"
