msgstr "I'm not exaggerating my fishing skills."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4"
