#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2"
msgid "靠这一条我炫耀不了什么。"
msgstr "This one won't earn me any bragging rights."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3"
