msgstr "I can't wait to put it in my mouth."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6"
