msgstr "It's very hot."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9"
