msgstr "Just a casual remark, but it might be useful to you."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE"
