msgstr "Something alive is inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR"
