msgstr "Not as good as the original tree, but not bad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE"
