msgstr "Academically termed \"tree noodles\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON"
