msgstr "What happens if I poke it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT"
