msgstr "Something seems to have been caught, but got away."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED"
