msgstr "Ready to catch fish again."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "它让钓鱼更有效率。"
msgstr "It makes fishing more efficient."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED"
