msgstr "Now, we wait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT"
