msgstr "It should be placed where the fish are plentiful."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC"
