msgstr "There should be decent shells inside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR"
msgid "最好的防守是一张好嘴。"
msgstr "The best defense is a good mouth."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHIRO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHIRO"
msgid "我的东西。在我的掌心里飞得不错。"
msgstr "Mine. She flies quite well in my palm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "地底下的事情很多。"
msgstr "Much goes on beneath the ground."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "挖土的可能性无穷。"
msgstr "The digging possibilities are endless."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT"
msgid "它闻起来像梦。"
msgstr "It smells like a dream."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE"
msgid "它名副其实。"
msgstr "It lives up to its name."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
