msgstr "Bumps and all."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "现在遮不了什么了。"
msgstr "It doesn't shelter much anymore."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
