msgstr "It comes out of a spider's rear."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SILK_ROBE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SILK_ROBE"
