#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS"
