#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM"
