msgstr "It gives me a bad feeling."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS"
