msgstr "Keep your hands to yourself. Understood."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "这里有点不对。但说不上来。"
msgstr "Something's off here. Can't say what."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "这里有点不对。但说不上来。"
msgstr "Something's off here. Can't say what."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "手别乱伸。可以吗。"
msgstr "Keep your hands to yourself. Understood."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "在我看来只是石头。"
msgstr "Looks like plain rock to me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "石头，石头，石头。"
msgstr "Rock, rock, rock."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "骸骨和影子融在一起了。"
msgstr "The skeleton and the shadow have merged."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "为什么非要长这么大。"
msgstr "Why did it have to grow this big."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "咬脚踝的小东西。"
msgstr "A little ankle-biter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC"
msgid "我们同意把过去的事放下。"
msgstr "We agreed to put the past behind us."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "人生有个方向总是好的。"
msgstr "A direction in life is always good."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "我打碎了。为了确认。"
msgstr "I smashed it. For verification."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "看不出那是什么。"
msgstr "Can't tell what that is."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
