msgstr "What the treasure is doesn't matter. The salvage is the fun part."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
