msgstr "It's shut tight."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
