msgstr "It cost me plenty to get this."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
