msgstr "I really should find time to fix that."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
