msgstr "It gives me great confidence."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "我真该抽空把那个修好。"
msgstr "I really should find time to fix that."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
