msgstr "How dreadful."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
