msgstr "Hard to swing it without doing a voice."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
