#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
