#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "要是有牙医，他会为此生气。"
msgstr "If there were dentists, they'd be angry about this."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "那只鸟很高。"
msgstr "That bird is very tall."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "它会孵出来吗。"
msgstr "Will it hatch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "好吃又有营养。"
msgstr "Tasty and nutritious."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
