msgstr "Is it shivering, or am I."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "它要孵了。"
msgstr "It's about to hatch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "蛋也会出汗吗。"
msgstr "Do eggs sweat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "这大概要花很长时间。"
msgstr "This will probably take a long while."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
