msgstr "Hard enough to withstand the most intense experiments."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
