msgstr "A terrible power is inside this metal potato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
