msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "说真的，他随手就把这些丢在各处。"
msgstr "Seriously, he just tosses these about everywhere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
