msgstr "I know someone who'd be delighted by this."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "希望它不会招来蜘蛛。"
msgstr "Hope it doesn't attract spiders."

