msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "这里很难找到像样的瓶子。"
msgstr "Decent bottles are hard to find here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "吃了那么多糖，大概需要这个。"
msgstr "After all that sugar, one probably needs these."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAKABA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "我不信那种东西。"
msgstr "I don't believe in that kind of thing."

