msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
msgid "又被挪到别处了。这种感觉，我不喜欢。"
msgstr "Teleported. ...I cannot take to this feeling."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF
