msgstr "Birds!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.DEER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.DEER"
msgid "鹿。对不起。"
msgstr "A deer. ...I am sorry."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.GENERIC"
msgid "碍事。退下。"
msgstr "In my way. ...Stand aside."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.PIG"
msgid "猪啊。……抱歉了。"
msgstr "A pig. ...Forgive me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.PREY"
msgid "猎物。速战速决。"
msgstr "Prey. ...Swiftly done."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.SPIDER"
msgid "蜘蛛。……抱歉，我不能留手。"
msgstr "A spider. ...A distant relative of Lady Shiro's, perhaps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "蜘蛛战士。不想打，但是得打。"
msgstr "A spider warrior. ...I have no wish to fight. But I must."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC"
