msgstr "It has gone. ...Over."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG"
msgid "这次放它走。"
msgstr "Let it go. This time."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY"
msgid "太快了。追不上。"
msgstr "Fast. ...I cannot catch it."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER"
msgid "不追了。……罪孽已经够多。"
msgstr "No chasing. ...My sins are heavy enough."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
