msgstr "The music comes from here."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "看着就不舒服。"
msgstr "It looks uncomfortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "有腥味。不过能吃。"
msgstr "Gamey. ...But it will do."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
