msgstr "Drying takes time."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
