#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
