#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC"
