#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT"
msgid "鱼人用的，我戴不上。"
msgstr "For merms. ...It does not fit me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT"
