msgstr "A dead merm, stirring!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD"
msgid "盯人盯得很紧。"
msgstr "A strong sense of surveillance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR"
msgid "鱼人往下一步变了。"
msgstr "The merm's next stage of evolution."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW"
msgid "只剩从前的影子。"
msgstr "Only the shadow of what it was."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT"
