msgstr "Today's foulest."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
