msgstr "Who lives here?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
