msgstr "With a king. ...They look glad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
