msgstr "All-purpose. ...But clumsy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED"
msgid "里面……讲究的东西大概不多。"
msgstr "Within. ...Slim hopes of anything scientific."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED"
msgid "里面……讲究的东西大概不多。"
msgstr "Within. ...Slim hopes of anything scientific."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
