#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST"
msgid "心脏。玩闹放在之后。"
