#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER"
msgid "%s……故事的素材，没了吗。"
msgstr "%s... Out of story material?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s……可靠。值得信任。"
msgstr "%s... Dependable. ...To be trusted."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT"
msgid "野外的事，我不太在行。"
msgstr "The outdoors. ...Not my strength."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER"
msgid "时间场合都不对。%s。"
msgstr "Wrong time, wrong place. %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WRATH.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "「时间线」？那是借口。"
