#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC"
msgid "借助月光的力量重创你的敌人！"
msgstr "Harness the moonlight to strike your enemies a heavy blow!"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE"
