msgstr "Use the power of shadows to protect yourself."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE"
msgid "暗影军团长"
msgstr "Shadow Legate"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ADVANCE_SPIDER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ADVANCE_SPIDER_DESC"
msgid "中幅提高血量上限及防御。"
msgstr "Moderately increases max Health and defense."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ADVANCE_SPIDER_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ADVANCE_SPIDER_LOCK_DESC"
msgid "没有进化为死神之镰。"
msgstr "Did not evolve into Death Scythe."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ADVANCE_SPIDER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ADVANCE_SPIDER_TITLE"
msgid "上级蜘蛛怪"
msgstr "Advanced Spider"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ARACHNE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ARACHNE_DESC"
msgid "得益于拥有两个脑袋，通过身体协同使得一次攻击造成两次伤害，\n并在每次重生后的第一次死亡时逃脱并恢复到最大HP。"
msgstr "With two heads working in concert, each attack strikes twice, \nand on the first death after each rebirth it escapes and recovers to full HP."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ARACHNE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_ARACHNE_TITLE"
