msgstr "Arachne"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_DEATH_SCYTHE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_DEATH_SCYTHE_DESC"
msgid "习得【腐蚀攻击】：使用近战武器造成伤害时附带腐蚀伤害。"
msgstr "Learn Erosion Attack: melee weapon damage carries bonus erosion damage."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_DEATH_SCYTHE_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_DEATH_SCYTHE_LOCK_DESC"
msgid "没有进化为上级蜘蛛怪。"
msgstr "Did not evolve into Advanced Spider."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_DEATH_SCYTHE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_DEATH_SCYTHE_TITLE"
msgid "死神之镰"
msgstr "Death Scythe"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_MEGA_SPIDER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_MEGA_SPIDER_DESC"
msgid "大幅提高血量上限及防御。"
msgstr "Greatly increases max Health and defense."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_MEGA_SPIDER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_MEGA_SPIDER_TITLE"
msgid "超级蜘蛛怪"
msgstr "Mega Spider"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_QUEEN_SPIDER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_QUEEN_SPIDER_DESC"
msgid "可以制作蜘蛛卵，并被视为蜘蛛女王+1，可以徒手雇佣无仇恨的蜘蛛。\n习得【产卵】：消耗体力制作随机蜘蛛。"
msgstr "Can craft spider eggs and is treated as Spider Queen +1, able to hire aggro-free spiders barehanded.\nLearn Spawning: spend Stamina to craft a random spider."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_QUEEN_SPIDER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_QUEEN_SPIDER_TITLE"
