msgid "习得【丝线制造】：可以消耗SP制作蜘蛛丝。"
msgstr "Learn Silk Crafting: spend SP to produce silk."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_TINY_SPIDER_METER_TITLE
