msgstr "Small Spider"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_UNDYING_QUEEN_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_UNDYING_QUEEN_DESC"
msgid "习得【不死】：HP归零时，可以选择尝试在原地恢复HP，并在HP恢复到最大时复活。"
msgstr "Learn Undying: when HP reaches zero, choose to attempt recovering HP on the spot, reviving once HP is fully restored."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_UNDYING_QUEEN_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SHIRO_EVOLUTION_UNDYING_QUEEN_TITLE"
msgid "不死蛛后"
msgstr "Undying Queen"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.SHIRO.SKANDA_DESC
